      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '"At midnight, while sitting alone in the house, I noticed strange sounds
    coming from outside. When I looked out the window, I saw a faint shadow under
    the flickering light of the streetlamp. My heart began to race, and my breath
    caught in my throat. The shadow moved slowly, as if it were coming straight toward
    me. As I walked toward the door, the creaking of the floorboards with each step
    sent chills down my spine. Suddenly, the doorknob turned slowly, and a cold breeze
    swept inside. At that moment, not knowing what was hiding in the darkness filled
    me with terror."'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
